---
import { personalInfo, education } from '../data/content';
---

<section id="about" class="section relative">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Image / Avatar Area -->
      <div class="relative group order-2 md:order-1">
        <div class="relative w-64 h-64 md:w-80 md:h-80 mx-auto">
          <!-- Gradient border -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 via-purple-500 to-cyan-500 rounded-3xl blur-xl opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
          
          <!-- Avatar container -->
          <div class="relative w-full h-full rounded-3xl overflow-hidden glass p-1">
            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-800 to-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center">
              <!-- Placeholder Avatar - Replace with your photo -->
              <div class="text-8xl md:text-9xl font-bold gradient-text">
                {personalInfo.name.split(' ').map(n => n[0]).join('')}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Floating badges -->
          <div class="absolute -right-4 top-1/4 glass px-4 py-2 rounded-xl animate-float">
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-indigo-400">5+ anos</span>
          </div>
          <div class="absolute -left-4 bottom-1/4 glass px-4 py-2 rounded-xl animate-float" style="animation-delay: 1s;">
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-cyan-400">Full Stack</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
        <p class="text-indigo-400 font-medium mb-2">Sobre Mim</p>
        <h2 class="section-title mb-6">
          Construindo soluções que escalam
        </h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Sou um desenvolvedor apaixonado por criar aplicações robustas e escaláveis. 
            Com mais de <strong class="text-white">5 anos de experiência</strong> no desenvolvimento 
            de sistemas críticos, tenho um histórico comprovado de entregar soluções que impactam 
            diretamente o negócio.
          </p>
          <p>
            Minha especialidade está em <strong class="text-white">TypeScript</strong> e 
            <strong class="text-white">Python</strong>, mas o que realmente me diferencia é 
            minha visão de ponta a ponta — do código à infraestrutura, da API ao dashboard de 
            monitoramento.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Education -->
        <div class="mt-8 p-4 rounded-xl glass">
          {education.map((edu) => (
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="text-3xl">{edu.icon}</div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">{edu.degree}</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400">{edu.institution}</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-indigo-400">{edu.period}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <!-- Stats -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8">
          <div class="text-center p-4 rounded-xl glass">
            <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">5+</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-slate-400">Anos Exp.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 rounded-xl glass">
            <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">30k+</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-slate-400">Trans/Mês</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 rounded-xl glass">
            <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">100%</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-slate-400">Docker</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
